docs/4023/ holds documents of the Институт точной механики и вычислительной техники
(ИТМиВТ), 1988, reproduced from the job decks on tape 4023: the decks (*.b6, with the
formatter passport adapted to run under dispak), their printouts (*.lst), the
facsimile PDFs and the LaTeX edition. The rights in the documents remain with their
owners; they are published here for historical research.

Not included; downloaded at build time:
    The volume images (disks/), from https://github.com/besm6/besm6.github.io
    (download/disks), published by the besm6 project.
    dispak, the БЭСМ-6 user-level simulator, https://github.com/besm6/dispak
    (GNU General Public License v2 or later), built from a pinned commit.
    Tectonic (https://tectonic-typesetting.github.io, MIT) for the LaTeX edition.
